# Reference fidelity (hard)

The user picks one reference site from the top 5 (`/refs`). From then on its **layout**,
**interaction model** and **motion driver** are binding. Matching mood, palette or fonts is **not** a pass.

**Keep:** section order, archetypes, element positions, media aspect and side, layered-media count,
CTA count and placement, signature layout devices, motion driver + role.
**Swap:** colors, logo, **all text/copy**, animation **implementation** (rebuild with `motion` —
never paste reference animation JS).
**Peer media (comp only):** photos, illustrations, textures, icons, shapes, backgrounds, video,
layered media. Capture → `brief/refs/<slug>/assets/` → copy to `public/_peer/` for build/overlay.
**Never take:** logo, brand name, any text (headlines, body, prices, testimonials, NAP), custom fonts.
Replace comps and delete `public/_peer/` before ship. Peer media in production = Blocker (user
override → log acceptance in `plan.md` Ops).

Fail words: "inspired by" · "same vibe" · "layout language" · "close enough" · "static is fine" ·
"layout first, motion later" · "skip animations".

## Blueprint row (`plan.md`, one per band, filled by `/refs`)

| # | Band + archetype | Measurements | Interaction | Motion | CTA | Do not invent |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | hero — split | media right, 55/45, aspect 4:5, text left | static | none | 2: primary + text link | no centred hero, no card frame |

**Measure the live page.** Prefer Playwright `getComputedStyle`
(`.cursor/skills/build/references/peer-extract.md`). Persist raw px to
`brief/refs/<slug>/measures/<band>.md` before `@theme` tokens. Raw px in components = fail.
Also read: layered media count, interaction model, motion (none / reveal / sticky / scrub / hover / load).

## Interaction + motion

Answer **scroll / click / hover / time / static** before coding. Scroll first; then click/hover.
Wrong driver = Blocker. Motion ≠ `none` → before→after at 375 + 1440 → `brief/refs/<slug>/states/`.
Rebuild with our stack; soft-pass "overlay OK so motion optional" = fail. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Peer media pipeline

1. Discover layers (`peer-extract.md`). Skip logos and assets that are mostly peer text.
2. Save under `brief/refs/<slug>/assets/`. If Playwright cannot save (e.g. CSS-only background), run
   the project copy of `templates/scripts/fetch-peer-asset.mjs` (scaffold puts it in `scripts/`).
3. Log each source URL in `brief/assets.md`. Copy into `public/_peer/` (gitignored) for comps + overlay.
4. Before ship: replace with client/licensed media; delete `public/_peer/`.

## Per-band check (`/build`)

1. Open the reference PNGs (`brief/refs/<ref>/…-band-N-375.png`, `-1440.png`). Missing → stop; run
   `/refs` step 3. A shop feature band (`feature — archetype of band N`) uses band N's screenshots
   (`layer-ecommerce.mdc`).
2. Read the row: measurements, interaction, motion, CTA, Do not invent.
3. Build with tokens; peer comps from `public/_peer/` OK. Screenshot → `.qa/build/<unit>-{375,1440}.png`.
4. **Overlay gate (required).** Copy the band PNG into `public/_peer/` and run the overlay recipe
   (`.cursor/skills/build/references/peer-extract.md` § 5): it lays the PNG over the running build with
   `mix-blend-mode: difference` and screenshots `.qa/build/overlay-<unit>-{375,1440}.png`. Near-black =
   aligned. Bright structure edges = fail. Brand-swap brightness (our colors/copy/logo) is expected.
   Missing overlay = do not show.
5. A labelled placeholder (client photo pending) is not a fidelity fail. **Photo source** `unsplash`:
   a placeholder still fails `/qa` (`design.mdc` → Assets).

## Logged reference exception

Hard lock (`design.mdc` Exception OK) fights the peer → log in `DESIGN.md` Decisions **and**
`plan.md` Reference exceptions as `Proposed`, stop looping, and ask the user. Only the user writes
`Approved: <name> <date>`. Until then the lock applies.

## Known failures (do not repeat)

| Failure | Fix |
|---|---|
| Mood matches, structure does not | same archetype and measurements as the row |
| Built from memory, PNG not open | open the PNGs first |
| Dual CTAs stacked at 375, reference keeps them inline | measure the mobile crop |
| Extra band the reference lacks | blueprint bands only |
| Chrome pad stacked / opaque wash / gutter eats max-width | count clearance once; transparent peer section; content-box width |
| Inner W×H pass; placement fails | log band `top`/`left` |
| Asset chase when structure is wrong | matching checksum → debug structure |
| Home-only screenshots | every live Sitemap route |
| Click UI when peer is scroll-driven | rewrite the driver |
| One image; peer has layered overlays | re-run asset discovery; capture every layer |
| Static build; peer moves | motion column + rebuild |
| Overlay unwinnable (lock vs peer) | logged reference exception |
| Peer comps / `public/_peer/` in production | replace; delete `_peer/` |

